[REACTION_OPTIONS]
RATE_UNITS HR
TEMPERATURE 25
[REACTION_SPECIES]
BULK CL2 MG
[REACTION_COEFFICIENTS]
PARAMETER kb 0.3
CONSTANT theta 1.07
[REACTION_PIPES]
RATE CL2 -kb * theta ^ (TEMP - 20) * CL2
[REACTION_TANKS]
RATE CL2 -kb * theta ^ (TEMP - 20) * CL2
[REACTION_QUALITY]
GLOBAL CL2 2
[REACTION_REPORT]
SPECIES ALL NO
SPECIES CL2 YES
